## Fine-Grained Grouped Vectorized Data Type (Amove Data Type)

术语是什么？
Amove提出的Fine-Grained Grouped Vectorized Data Type是一种支持LLM细粒度W4A4和低比特weight-only量化的向量化数据格式。它在MX (Microscaling)格式的基础上扩展：每个coarse-grained group不仅包含shared scale factor和quantized elements，还额外引入shared residual和per-cluster encodings。数据格式结构：`[Base Scale (FP8 E4M3) | Residual (FP8 E4M3) | K/C encodings (2-bit each) | K elements (INT4/FP4/scalar data type)]`。其中K是group size，C是cluster size。与MX格式的关键区别：(1) 通过residual+encoding机制而非单一shared scale恢复fine-grained cluster scale factor；(2) 支持灵活的group/cluster/encoding配置；(3) 可集成任意scalar data type（INT4、FP4、M-ANT等）作为element格式；(4) Byte-aligned memory access设计（例如W3A3时：32 elem×3b=96b + 8b base + 8b residual + 8×2b encoding = 128b per group）。

从算法pipeline角度拆解术语：
该数据类型的quantize和dequantize流程：
```
// Quantize: FP16 matrix → Amove data format
Amove_Quantize(W_fp16, group_size=G, cluster_size=C, encoding_bits=E):
    for each group g in W_fp16 (size G along channel dim for weights):
        // 1. Select base scale (max of all cluster scales in group)
        Δ_base = max(compute_cluster_scales(group, C))

        // 2. Compute residual (see Residual Approximation Mechanism)
        R = compute_residual(group, Δ_base, C, E)

        // 3. Compute per-cluster encodings
        for each cluster i in 0..(G/C-1):
            Δ_i = compute_cluster_scale(cluster_i)
            E_i = floor((Δ_i - Δ_base) / R)  // ∈ [-2^{E-1}-1, 0]

        // 4. Quantize each element
        for each cluster i:
            S_i = Δ_base - R * E_i  // approximate scale
            for each element e in cluster_i:
                e_q = round(e / S_i)  // → INT4

        // 5. Pack into Amove format
        group_packed = pack(FP8(Δ_base), FP8(R), E_0..E_{K-1}, e_q_0..e_q_{G-1})

// Dequantize: Amove format → FP16 for computation
Amove_Dequantize(group_packed):
    Δ_base, R, E[], Q[] = unpack(group_packed)
    for each cluster i:
        S_i = Δ_base - R * E[i]
        X_hat[i] = Q[i] * S_i  // INT4 * FP16 scale → FP16
    return X_hat
```

